{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>Of Shefufam.</b> It is Muppim." "<b>Of Hufam.</b> It is Hupham. And five of Benjamin's sons died — Bela's five: Ehi, and Noaman, Rosh, and Ard. This is what Rashi explained above: five families of the tribe of Benjamin disappeared, and seven families remained to him — the five from five of his sons, and the two from two of his grandsons."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:19:50.953414017Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}